{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/897433-what-are-you-using-for-your-online-gaming","id":897433,"title":"What are you using for your Online Gaming?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-23T18:56:56-07:00","id":897433,"title":"What are you using for your Online Gaming?","content":"In the What is Origins discussion there was a point brought up about online play. Right now my group is using a combination of Google Docs, Skype and various online die rollers. I truly miss the days of Google Wave where all three could be in one wave with hidden conversations, etc. <br /> <br /> I'd like to hear if someone has a superior method of gaming online. I mean what we have works fine but maybe there is something out there that works better. I'd like to hear everyone's thoughts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/333-achilles","name":"Achilles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar333_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T19:49:56-07:00","id":897490,"title":"","content":"I use EpicTable, but any number of virtual table tops would do the job (including tracking pools and momentum).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1011-phgraves","name":"PHGraves","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1011_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-24T08:02:33-07:00","id":897808,"title":"","content":"I use a combination of Fa